WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.223
Unit six. Water Safety!

2
00:00:04.175 --> 00:00:07.938
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.988 --> 00:00:11.683
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.733 --> 00:00:15.374
Today we learn about Water Safety. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.557
Swim. Say it with me. Swim!

6
00:00:23.061 --> 00:00:27.078
Lifeguard. Say it with me. Lifeguard!

7
00:00:30.576 --> 00:00:34.626
Life jacket. Say it with me. Life jacket!

8
00:00:38.126 --> 00:00:42.143
Pool rules. Say it with me. Pool rules!

9
00:00:45.643 --> 00:00:49.426
Deep water. Say it with me. Deep water!

10
00:00:52.909 --> 00:00:56.109
Float. Say it with me. Float!

11
00:00:59.613 --> 00:01:03.246
Drown. Say it with me. Drown!

12
00:01:06.742 --> 00:01:10.842
Supervise. Say it with me. Supervise!

13
00:01:14.345 --> 00:01:24.249
I only swim where a lifeguard can supervise. I wear a life jacket in deep water and always follow pool rules. Learning to float can help prevent someone from starting to drown.

14
00:01:24.299 --> 00:01:25.467
I can do that too!

15
00:01:26.897 --> 00:01:32.070
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:33.270
Life jacket!

17
00:01:34.269 --> 00:01:39.559
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.609 --> 00:01:40.759
Drown!

19
00:01:41.585 --> 00:01:47.168
Did you know? Learning to swim at a young age greatly reduces the risk of drowning!

20
00:01:47.218 --> 00:01:49.197
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:49.969 --> 00:01:58.117
Think and answer. What water safety rule is most important to you?

22
00:01:58.167 --> 00:01:59.317
Great answer!

23
00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:05.053
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:05.103 --> 00:02:07.754
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

